  Try another wizard.  Google for a thread titled something like
"How do you keep a wizard alive".


  For all characters:

  1. Don't die.  Dead characters don't ascend.

  2. Get and use a ranged attack.  (For wizards it's daggers.)  
     If the enemy is in melee range, so are you.

  3. Test all non-cursed armor for enchantment.

  4. Use pets.  They won't always get you out of trouble, but 
     they can keep you out of trouble.  (If pacifists can ascend
     using pets, the rest of us can stay alive using them.)


  (For real fun, play a chaotic human wizard.  If you find Fort
Ludious, lead all the humans there to the nearest altar & 
sacrifice them.  That should give you enough foocubi to get to
XL 30.)

